# File: apps/worker/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# Purpose:
#   Buildkit-specific ignore file for apps/worker/Dockerfile only (matched by
#   name against the Dockerfile in this directory). Keeps the worker image
#   build reproducible by excluding host-local build/install artifacts and
#   secrets from the Docker build context instead of relying on whatever
#   happens to exist in the developer's working tree.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
